p/3000x1688+0+322/resize/600/quality/85/format/jpeg/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F98%2Fe8%2F8146a0a5486eb1dbdf90104187e4%2Fap26238709831112.jpg 600w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/3000x1688+0+322/resize/800/quality/85/format/jpeg/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F98%2Fe8%2F8146a0a5486eb1dbdf90104187e4%2Fap26238709831112.jpg 800w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/3000x1688+0+322/resize/900/quality/85/format/jpeg/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F98%2Fe8%2F8146a0a5486eb1dbdf90104187e4%2Fap26238709831112.jpg 900w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/3000x1688+0+322/resize/1200/quality/85/format/jpeg/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F98%2Fe8%2F8146a0a5486eb1dbdf90104187e4%2Fap26238709831112.jpg 1200w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/3000x1688+0+322/resize/1600/quality/85/format/jpeg/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F98%2Fe8%2F8146a0a5486eb1dbdf90104187e4%2Fap26238709831112.jpg 1600w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/3000x1688+0+322/resize/1800/quality/85/format/jpeg/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F98%2Fe8%2F8146a0a5486eb1dbdf90104187e4%2Fap26238709831112.jpg 1800w" data-template="https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/3000x1688+0+322/resize/{width}/quality/{quality}/format/{format}/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F98%2Fe8%2F8146a0a5486eb1dbdf90104187e4%2Fap26238709831112.jpg" sizes="(min-width: 1025px) 650px, calc(100vw - 30px)" class="img" type="image/jpeg" /&gt;             &lt;img src="https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/3000x1688+0+322/resize/1100/quality/50/format/jpeg/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F98%2Fe8%2F8146a0a5486eb1dbdf90104187e4%2Fap26238709831112.jpg" data-template="https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/3000x1688+0+322/resize/{width}/quality/{quality}/format/{format}/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F98%2Fe8%2F8146a0a5486eb1dbdf90104187e4%2Fap26238709831112.jpg" class="img" alt="Released prisoner of war Lt. Col. Robert L. Stirm is greeted by his family at Travis Air Force Base in Fairfield, Calif., as he returns home from the Vietnam War, March 17, 1973." loading="lazy" /&gt;         &lt;/picture&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div class="credit-caption"&gt;     &lt;div class="caption-wrap"&gt;         &lt;div class="caption" aria-label="Image caption"&gt;             &lt;p&gt;                 Released prisoner of war Lt. Col. Robert L. Stirm is greeted by his family at Travis Air Force Base in Fairfield, Calif., as he returns home from the Vietnam War, March 17, 1973.                 &lt;b class="credit" aria-label="Image credit"&gt;                                          Sal Veder/AP                                      &lt;/b&gt;                 &lt;b class="hide-caption"&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/b&gt;             &lt;/p&gt;         &lt;/div&gt;               &lt;b class="toggle-caption"&gt;               &lt;svg class="icon icon--info"&gt;&lt;use href="#icon-info"&gt;&lt;/use&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;               &lt;b&gt;&lt;/b&gt;             &lt;/b&gt;     &lt;/div&gt;       &lt;/div&gt;    &lt;/div&gt;    &lt;p&gt;Photojournalist Slava "Sal" Veder died at the age of 99 on Aug. 22, eight days before his 100th birthday. He was best known for his Pulitzer Prize-winning photo "Burst of Joy," which captured a U.S. Air Force lieutenant colonel reuniting with his family after five years in a Vietnam prisoner-of-war camp. During his three-decade career at the Associated Press, Veder documented significant political events and figures, including Dianne Feinstein's election as San Francisco mayor following Mayor George Moscone's assassination and political activist Angela Davis' conspiracy for murder trial. See &lt;a href="https://www.npr.org/sections/the-picture-show/2026/08/27/g-s1-140490/a-pulitzer-prize-winning-photographer-who-shot-an-iconic-vietnam-war-era-photo-has-died" target="_blank"&gt;photos of some of Veder's works&lt;/a&gt; throughout his AP career.&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;h3 class="edTag"&gt;3 things to know before you go&lt;/h3&gt;   &lt;div id="resg-s1-141141" class="bucketwrap image large"&gt;             &lt;div     class="imagewrap has-source-dimensions"     data-crop-type=""     style="         --source-width: 6240;         --source-height: 3510;     " &gt;         &lt;picture&gt;             &lt;source srcset="https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/6240x3510+0+325/resize/400/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fa0%2F2a%2Fa2da2c2e4d31bb0c94d5c25b7d6c%2Fdawn-eric-philips-2.jpg 400w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/6240x3510+0+325/resize/600/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fa0%2F2a%2Fa2da2c2e4d31bb0c94d5c25b7d6c%2Fdawn-eric-philips-2.jpg 600w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/6240x3510+0+325/resize/800/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fa0%2F2a%2Fa2da2c2e4d31bb0c94d5c25b7d6c%2Fdawn-eric-philips-2.jpg 800w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/6240x3510+0+325/resize/900/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fa0%2F2a%2Fa2da2c2e4d31bb0c94d5c25b7d6c%2Fdawn-eric-philips-2.jpg 900w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/6240x3510+0+325/resize/1200/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fa0%2F2a%2Fa2da2c2e4d31bb0c94d5c25b7d6c%2Fdawn-eric-philips-2.jpg 1200w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/6240x3510+0+325/resize/1600/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fa0%2F2a%2Fa2da2c2e4d31bb0c94d5c25b7d6c%2Fdawn-eric-philips-2.jpg 1600w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/6240x3510+0+325/resize/1800/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fa0%2F2a%2Fa2da2c2e4d31bb0c94d5c25b7d6c%2Fdawn-eric-philips-2.jpg 1800w" data-template="https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/6240x3510+0+325/resize/{width}/quality/{quality}/format/{format}/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fa0%2F2a%2Fa2da2c2e4d31bb0c94d5c25b7d6c%2Fdawn-eric-philips-2.jpg" sizes="(min-width: 1025px) 650px, calc(100vw - 30px)" class="img" type="image/webp" /&gt;             &lt;source srcset="https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/6240x3510+0+325/resize/400/quality/85/format/jpeg/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fa0%2F2a%2Fa2da2c2e4d31bb0c94d5c25b7d6c%2Fdawn-eric-philips-2.jpg 400w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/6240x3510+0+325/resize/600/quality/85/format/jpeg/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fa0%2F2a%2Fa2da2c2e4d31bb0c94d5c25b7d6c%2Fdawn-eric-philips-2.jpg 600w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/6240x3510+0+325/resize/800/quality/85/format/jpeg/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fa0%2F2a%2Fa2da2c2e4d31bb0c94d5c25b7d6c%2Fdawn-eric-philips-2.jpg 800w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/6240x3510+0+325/resize/900/quality/85/format/jpeg/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fa0%2F2a%2Fa2da2c2e4d31bb0c94d5c25b7d6c%2Fdawn-eric-philips-2.jpg 900w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/6240x3510+0+325/resize/1200/quality/85/format/jpeg/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fa0%2F2a%2Fa2da2c2e4d31bb0c94d5c25b7d6c%2Fdawn-eric-philips-2.jpg 1200w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/6240x3510+0+325/resize/1600/quality/85/format/jpeg/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fa0%2F2a%2Fa2da2c2e4d31bb0c94d5c25b7d6c%2Fdawn-eric-philips-2.jpg 1600w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/6240x3510+0+325/resize/1800/quality/85/format/jpeg/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fa0%2F2a%2Fa2da2c2e4d31bb0c94d5c25b7d6c%2Fdawn-eric-philips-2.jpg 1800w" data-template="https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/6240x3510+0+325/resize/{width}/quality/{quality}/format/{format}/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fa0%2F2a%2Fa2da2c2e4d31bb0c94d5c25b7d6c%2Fdawn-eric-philips-2.jpg" sizes="(min-width: 1025px) 650px, calc(100vw - 30px)" class="img" type="image/jpeg" /&gt;             &lt;img src="https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/6240x3510+0+325/resize/1100/quality/50/format/jpeg/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fa0%2F2a%2Fa2da2c2e4d31bb0c94d5c25b7d6c%2Fdawn-eric-philips-2.jpg" data-template="https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/6240x3510+0+325/resize/{width}/quality/{quality}/format/{format}/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fa0%2F2a%2Fa2da2c2e4d31bb0c94d5c25b7d6c%2Fdawn-eric-philips-2.jpg" class="img" alt="The first ever Fat Marmot Week ends on August 30, 2026." loading="lazy" /&gt;         &lt;/picture&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div class="credit-caption"&gt;     &lt;div class="caption-wrap"&gt;         &lt;div class="caption" aria-label="Image caption"&gt;             &lt;p&gt;                 The first ever Fat Marmot Week ends on August 30, 2026.                 &lt;b class="credit" aria-label="Image credit"&gt;                                          Eric Philips                                      &lt;/b&gt;                 &lt;b class="hide-caption"&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/b&gt;             &lt;/p&gt;         &lt;/div&gt;               &lt;b class="toggle-caption"&gt;               &lt;svg class="icon icon--info"&gt;&lt;use href="#icon-info"&gt;&lt;/use&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;               &lt;b&gt;&lt;/b&gt;             &lt;/b&gt;     &lt;/div&gt;       &lt;/div&gt;    &lt;/div&gt;    &lt;ol class="edTag"&gt;&lt;li&gt;Dawn has been crowned the inaugural winner of Rocky Mountain Biological Laboratory's &lt;a href="https://www.npr.org/2026/08/30/nx-s1-5945683/exclusive-meet-the-inaugural-winner-of-fat-marmot-week" target="_blank"&gt;Fat Marmot Week&lt;/a&gt;. The competition is inspired by Alaska's Fat Bear Week.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Generative AI videos of late-night talk show hosts are increasingly spreading on social media. These videos are easier to make than deepfakes of other celebrities, since the hosts speak directly to the camera. They &lt;a href="https://www.npr.org/2026/08/30/nx-s1-5943190/jimmy-kimmel-deepfake-jon-stewart-abc-ai" target="_blank"&gt;could be more disruptive&lt;/a&gt; because audiences are more inclined to accept their context.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;The Federal Trade Commission is &lt;a href="https://www.npr.org/2026/08/31/nx-s1-5950482/ftc-amazon-advertising-lawsuit" target="_blank"&gt;suing Amazon again&lt;/a&gt;, alleging that the tech giant has pocketed tens of billions of dollars by "secretly and systemically overcharging advertisers on its platform."&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;       &lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;This newsletter was edited by &lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.npr.org/people/859721331/suzanne-nuyen"target="_blank"   &gt;&lt;em&gt;Suzanne Nuyen&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;/div&gt;</description>
